{
  "name": "@deepseek-ai/dsh-bi-webi",
  "description": "webi BI-source provider (ctx.biSource) for the DeepSeek Harness Control Plane — the fixed webi routes, per-operation API-key resolution, row and cell bounds, and closed failure mapping",
